Z||000000||kempo||07-22-2001||09:33 PM||||I first want to say that I had the best time I've had in a long, long time.  Thank you so much for the invite.  I am so happy that I was able to attend.  To everybody that was there, you have my personal thanks for making Tom and I feel welcomed into the Fiero group.  We both had a great time and greatly appreciate the hospitality and the best parking spot in the house!  You all have made us feel very welcomed.  It was a pleasure to meet you all!  My only regret was not being able to stay longer, but there is nothing that could be done about it (work sucks!)  Thanks again... and enjoy the peanuts!<P>-Kemp<BR>(Jen- didn't mean to offend you with anything I said =)  ||||reg||6
Z||000001||Brucepts||07-22-2001||09:39 PM||||Its was good to have you!! Good to see you made it home safe and sound  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Gee not one word about the ride in the 3800s/c? U gonna make copies of the video you took of your buddy's ride? It was kinda like going to an amusement park for Fiero addicts huh?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Advanced Dealer in the Great Material Continuum . . .<BR>Non Fiero Website: <A HREF="http://tractorsport.com" TARGET=_blank>http://tractorsport.com</A> <BR>You can't race a dyno . . .||||reg||1
Z||000002||kempo||07-22-2001||09:44 PM||||That 3800 was the fastest ride I've ever been in - and very much appreciate the ride!  Hold on to anything you can, for as long as you can...  As far as the footage goes, it'll be implanted into my memory and I'm going to have sweet dreams about it every night for a long long time!  Sheeeeeesh... that thing was fast!  <P>-Kemp||||reg||1
